  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "start",
      "html": "<section class=\"section\" id=\"start\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"section-header\"><h2 class=\"section-title\">Choose DS / DS Lite or DSi</h2></div><div class=\"games-grid\"><article class=\"guide-resource\" data-search=\"nintendo ds / ds lite · flashcart use a supported flashcart and its microsd card. the twilight menu++ flashcard package is separate from the dsi and 3ds sd-card builds.\"><img src=\"/assets/images/expansion-nintendo-retro/twilight.png\" alt=\"Nintendo DS / DS Lite · flashcart artwork\" loading=\"lazy\"><h3>Nintendo DS / DS Lite · flashcart</h3><p>Use a supported flashcart and its microSD card. The TWiLight Menu++ Flashcard package is separate from the DSi and 3DS SD-card builds.</p><div class=\"guide-links\"><a href=\"https://wiki.ds-homebrew.com/twilightmenu/installing-flashcard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Read flashcart setup guide <i class=\"fas fa-external-link-alt\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></a></div></article>\n<article class=\"guide-resource\" data-search=\"nintendo dsi / dsi xl · sd card use the maintained dsi guide for an sd-card entry point, homebrew setup and a nand backup. it also explains the optional unlaunch bootcode installation and its risks.\"><img src=\"/assets/images/expansion-nintendo-retro/godmode9i.png\" alt=\"Nintendo DSi / DSi XL · SD card artwork\" loading=\"lazy\"><h3>Nintendo DSi / DSi XL · SD card</h3><p>Use the maintained DSi guide for an SD-card entry point, homebrew setup and a NAND backup. It also explains the optional Unlaunch bootcode installation and its risks.</p><div class=\"guide-links\"><a href=\"https://dsi.cfw.guide/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Read DSi setup guide <i class=\"fas fa-external-link-alt\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></a></div></article></div><p>For Nintendo 2DS, 3DS and New models, use the separate <a href=\"/console/retro/3ds.html\">2DS / 3DS page <i class=\"fas fa-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></a>. Those systems have their own CFW setup and TWiLight Menu++ package.</p></div></section>"
    },
    {
      "id": "apps",
      "html": "<section class=\"section\" id=\"apps\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"section-header\"><h2 class=\"section-title\">DS / DSi apps & homebrew tools</h2></div><div class=\"games-grid\"><article id=\"twilight\" class=\"guide-resource\" data-search=\"ds / dsi flashcart / sd launcher 27.25.1 twilight menu++ a menu for ds-mode homebrew and nds-bootstrap. choose the flashcard package for a ds / ds lite flashcart, or the dsi package for a prepared dsi sd card.\"><img src=\"/assets/images/expansion-nintendo-retro/twilight.png\" alt=\"TWiLight Menu++ project logo\" loading=\"lazy\"><h3>TWiLight Menu++</h3><div class=\"game-features\" aria-label=\"Resource tags\"><span class=\"feature\">27.25.1</span><span class=\"feature\">DS / DSi</span><span class=\"feature\">Flashcart / SD</span><span class=\"feature\">Launcher</span></div><p>A menu for DS-mode homebrew and nds-bootstrap. Choose the Flashcard package for a DS / DS Lite flashcart, or the DSi package for a prepared DSi SD card.</p><div class=\"guide-links\"><a href=\"https://github.com/DS-Homebrew/TWiLightMenu/releases/download/v27.25.1/TWiLightMenu-Flashcard.7z\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Download Flashcard 7z <i class=\"fas fa-external-link-alt\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></a><a href=\"https://github.com/DS-Homebrew/TWiLightMenu/releases/download/v27.25.1/TWiLightMenu-DSi.7z\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Download DSi 7z <i class=\"fas fa-external-link-alt\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></a><a href=\"https://github.com/DS-Homebrew/TWiLightMenu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Project &amp; requirements <i class=\"fas fa-external-link-alt\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></a><a href=\"https://wiki.ds-homebrew.com/twilightmenu/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Setup &amp; documentation <i class=\"fas fa-external-link-alt\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></a></div></article>\n<article id=\"nds-bootstrap\" class=\"guide-resource\" data-search=\"ds / dsi loading backend homebrew 2.17.0 nds-bootstrap ds(i) loading backend used by twilight menu++. normally update it through your menu; standalone files are here for documented manual setups.\"><img src=\"/assets/images/expansion-nintendo-retro/nds-bootstrap.png\" alt=\"nds-bootstrap tenth anniversary project logo\" loading=\"lazy\"><h3>nds-bootstrap</h3><div class=\"game-features\" aria-label=\"Resource tags\"><span class=\"feature\">2.17.0</span><span class=\"feature\">DS / DSi</span><span class=\"feature\">Loading backend</span><span class=\"feature\">Homebrew</span></div><p>DS(i) loading backend used by TWiLight Menu++. Normally update it through your menu; standalone files are here for documented manual setups.</p><div class=\"guide-links\"><a href=\"https://github.com/DS-Homebrew/nds-bootstrap/releases/download/v2.17.0/nds-bootstrap.zip\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Download bootstrap ZIP <i class=\"fas fa-external-link-alt\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></a><a href=\"https://github.com/DS-Homebrew/nds-bootstrap\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Project &amp; requirements <i class=\"fas fa-external-link-alt\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></a><a href=\"https://wiki.ds-homebrew.com/nds-bootstrap/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Setup &amp; documentation <i class=\"fas fa-external-link-alt\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></a></div></article>\n<article id=\"godmode9i\" class=\"guide-resource\" data-search=\"file manager cartridge backups ds / dsi 3.10.0 godmode9i browse files, inspect data and back up supported cartridges or saves. cartridge access depends on the model and launch method; dsi slot-1 dumping requires unlaunch.\"><img src=\"/assets/images/expansion-nintendo-retro/godmode9i.png\" alt=\"GodMode9i file-list screenshot\" loading=\"lazy\"><h3>GodMode9i</h3><div class=\"game-features\" aria-label=\"Resource tags\"><span class=\"feature\">3.10.0</span><span class=\"feature\">File manager</span><span class=\"feature\">Cartridge backups</span><span class=\"feature\">DS / DSi</span></div><p>Browse files, inspect data and back up supported cartridges or saves. Cartridge access depends on the model and launch method; DSi Slot-1 dumping requires Unlaunch.</p><div class=\"guide-links\"><a href=\"https://github.com/DS-Homebrew/GodMode9i/releases/download/v3.10.0/GodMode9i.7z\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Download DS / DSi 7z <i class=\"fas fa-external-link-alt\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></a><a href=\"https://github.com/DS-Homebrew/GodMode9i\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Project &amp; requirements <i class=\"fas fa-external-link-alt\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></a><a href=\"https://wiki.ds-homebrew.com/godmode9i/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Setup &amp; documentation <i class=\"fas fa-external-link-alt\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></a></div></article>\n<article id=\"ftpd-ds\" class=\"guide-resource\" data-search=\"nds ftp wireless transfers 3.2.1 ftpd · nintendo ds build transfer files over a local wireless network using an ftp client. launch the nds build through your compatible ds homebrew setup and connect to the address it displays.\"><img src=\"/assets/images/expansion-nintendo-retro/ftpd.png\" alt=\"ftpd project banner\" loading=\"lazy\"><h3>ftpd · Nintendo DS build</h3><div class=\"game-features\" aria-label=\"Resource tags\"><span class=\"feature\">3.2.1</span><span class=\"feature\">NDS</span><span class=\"feature\">FTP</span><span class=\"feature\">Wireless transfers</span></div><p>Transfer files over a local wireless network using an FTP client. Launch the NDS build through your compatible DS homebrew setup and connect to the address it displays.</p><div class=\"guide-links\"><a href=\"https://github.com/mtheall/ftpd/releases/download/v3.2.1/ftpd.nds\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Download ftpd.nds <i class=\"fas fa-external-link-alt\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></a><a href=\"https://github.com/mtheall/ftpd\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Project &amp; requirements <i class=\"fas fa-external-link-alt\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></a></div></article></div></div></section>"
    },
    {
      "id": "setup",
      "html": "<section class=\"section\" id=\"setup\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"section-header\"><h2 class=\"section-title\">Prepare and launch DS homebrew</h2></div><ol class=\"guide-steps\"><li><strong>Choose the right package</strong>A DS / DS Lite uses the Flashcard TWiLight package with a compatible flashcart. A DSi SD-card setup uses the DSi package and its documented entry point.</li><li><strong>Keep the supplied folder layout</strong>Extract the package and follow the matching installation page. For the Flashcard package, its <code>_nds</code> folder, <code>roms</code> folder and documented boot NDS file go at the flashcart microSD root.</li><li><strong>Use the correct app format</strong>Open the NDS or DSi build through the launcher specified by the project. GodMode9i’s cartridge functions have additional model-specific access requirements.</li><li><strong>Keep a backup before changes</strong>Copy your existing saves and SD files before replacing a setup. On DSi, follow the NAND-backup instructions before choosing whether to install Unlaunch.</li></ol><ul class=\"guide-source-list\"><li><a href=\"https://wiki.ds-homebrew.com/twilightmenu/installing-flashcard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Flashcart installation · supported boot files and card-specific settings <i class=\"fas fa-external-link-alt\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></a></li><li><a href=\"https://wiki.ds-homebrew.com/twilightmenu/installing-dsi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">DSi installation · SD-card package and entry point <i class=\"fas fa-external-link-alt\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></a></li><li><a href=\"https://dsi.cfw.guide/dumping-nand.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">DSi NAND backup procedure <i class=\"fas fa-external-link-alt\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></a></li><li><a href=\"https://wiki.ds-homebrew.com/godmode9i/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">GodMode9i · cartridge and save access by model <i class=\"fas fa-external-link-alt\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></a></li></ul></div></section>"
    },
    {
      "id": "more",
      "html": "<section class=\"section\" id=\"more\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"section-header\"><h2 class=\"section-title\">More DS / DSi homebrew</h2></div><p>Browse the maintained DS-Homebrew documentation for compatibility and usage, or Universal-DB for additional homebrew projects. Check each app’s supported launch mode before copying it to your console.</p><div class=\"guide-links\"><a href=\"https://wiki.ds-homebrew.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">DS-Homebrew documentation <i class=\"fas fa-external-link-alt\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></a><a href=\"https://db.universal-team.net/ds\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">DS homebrew directory <i class=\"fas fa-external-link-alt\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></a><a href=\"/console/retro/3ds.html#twilight-3ds\">TWiLight Menu++ on 3DS <i class=\"fas fa-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></a></div></div></section>"
    }
